# Shree Industry - E-commerce Front-End

A modern, professional, and aesthetic e-commerce front-end built with React and Tailwind CSS for Shree Industry a company that supplies metal products used in construction (e.g., steel rods, metal sheets, iron bars, beams).

---

## 🚀 Project Overview

This project is a clean and responsive front-end interface showcasing Shree Industry’s product offerings. It emphasizes industrial strength, reliability, and usability through a dark-themed, grid-based design.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- React – JavaScript library for building user interfaces
- Tailwind CSS – Utility-first CSS framework for custom design
- Vite / CRA – (Depending on your setup) for fast development and build

---

### ✅ Pages

- Homepage  
  - Hero section with a bold introduction to Shree Industry
  - Highlights durability, strength, and quality of products

- Products Page  
  - Grid layout displaying metal products  
  - Includes image, name, brief description, and price  
  - No filtering, sorting, or cart functionality

- Product Detail Page  
  - Large product image  
  - Detailed description, specifications, and price  

- Responsive Header  
  - Logo and navigation (Home, Products, About Us, Contact)

- Footer  
  - Company info, contact links, and social media handles

---

## 🎨 Design Guidelines

- Color Palette:  
  - Industrial tones like steel gray, charcoal, and muted metallics  
  - Accent colors as needed (e.g., muted blue or orange)

- Typography:  
  - Modern, readable fonts for both headings and body text

- Layout:  
  - Fully responsive with clean grid and spacing  
  - Mobile-first design

---
